-- County highlight image seed from Wikimedia Commons file search.
-- Generated from data/counties/highlight_images_raw.json with manual review
-- of obvious false positives. Skipped for now: bungoma, embu, garissa, isiolo, kakamega, kwale, mandera, tharaka-nithi, vihiga.
-- Remote URLs and attribution metadata are stored; no image binaries are
-- downloaded or redistributed by this migration.

